            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The rig's second USB port (\"Standard COM Port\"), not rigctld's. On the rig set CW SETTING → MODE CW → PC KEYING to %@, and leave RPTT SELECT there OFF. Changing these disarms."
          }
